---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="Boulder Box Saigon - Case Study">
  <Header basePath="/" />

  <main class="pt-24" style="background: linear-gradient(40deg, #071207 0%, #0d2c1a 100%)">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center py-24" style="background-image: url('/assets/projects/bbo-image-01.avif'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.45), rgba(0,0,0,0.85));"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10" style="max-width: 860px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 100%; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px;">
        <h1 class="text-[36px] sm:text-[56px] md:text-[100px] leading-none font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">Boulder Box Saigon</h1>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-[15px]" style="color: rgb(255,184,0);">
          <span>Role: Founder &amp; BD Head</span>
          <span style="opacity:0.4;">|</span>
          <span>Timeline: Aug 2023 – Present</span>
          <span style="opacity:0.4;">|</span>
          <span>Status: <a href="https://bbo.fitness" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">Live</a></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-cue">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Case Study Body -->
    <div class="case-study-body reveal-hidden">

      <section class="case-section">
        <h2 class="case-section-title">1. The TL;DR <span class="case-section-sub">(Executive Summary)</span></h2>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">The Purpose</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Vietnam&#39;s first boutique bouldering concept &mdash; bringing sport climbing into the urban home and lifestyle space.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">The Stakeholders</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Olivia Nguyen, Founder &amp; Business Development Head</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">The Problem</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Vietnam had no accessible, high-quality bouldering facilities and no local business model to reference. Building one from scratch required market education, supply chain problem-solving, and full cultural adaptation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">The Solution</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">A home-scale boutique bouldering gym designed around community, quality coaching, and a digital-physical growth strategy under the Boulder Box brand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">The Impact</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">250% year-over-year sales growth from launch, 100% PT program retention rate in year one, and 160+ participants in organic community events.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="case-section">
        <h2 class="case-section-title">2. Strategy &amp; Discovery</h2>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Insight</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Vietnam&#39;s fitness market lacked accessible indoor climbing. Positioning as &ldquo;climbing meets lifestyle&rdquo; unlocked a new demographic beyond hardcore sport climbers, making the concept approachable to urban young professionals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Stakeholders</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Self-led initiative. Coordinated with local contractors, climbing coaches, and community fitness influencers across Ho Chi Minh City.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Constraint</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">No local market data, a near-nonexistent climbing gear supply chain in Vietnam, and no comparable business model to benchmark &mdash; everything had to be built from first principles.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="case-section">
        <h2 class="case-section-title">3. Execution <span class="case-section-sub">(The &ldquo;How&rdquo;)</span></h2>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Key Decision</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Positioned as a home-scale boutique rather than a large competition-style gym. This prioritized intimacy and quality coaching over scale, aligning with the urban lifestyle audience and keeping construction costs manageable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Design Leadership</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Led end-to-end construction design, brand identity, coaching program structure, digital presence (bbo.fitness), community events, and business development &mdash; all without a team playbook.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Visual Highlights</h3>
          <div class="gallery-wrap">
            <div class="gallery-track-wrap">
              <div class="gallery-track" id="galleryTrack">
                <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-01.avif" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
                <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-02.webp" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
                <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-03.avif" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
                <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-10.webp" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
                <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-11.avif" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
                <img class="gallery-img" src="/assets/projects/bbo-image-12.webp" alt="Boulder Box Saigon" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-controls">
              <button class="gallery-btn" id="galleryPrev" aria-label="Previous">&#8592; Back</button>
              <span class="gallery-counter" id="galleryCounter">1 / 6</span>
              <button class="gallery-btn" id="galleryNext" aria-label="Next">Next &#8594;</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="case-section">
        <h2 class="case-section-title">4. Outcome &amp; Lessons</h2>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">KPIs</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">250% year-over-year sales growth from launch. 100% PT program retention rate in year one. 160+ participants in organic community events.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="case-field">
          <h3 class="case-field-label">Next Steps</h3>
          <p class="case-field-value">Expand to a second facility, deepen digital community engagement via bbo.fitness, and develop a route-setting curriculum for coach training.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Explorer share section (hidden until explorer mode active) -->
    <div style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 96px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
      <div id="bboShareSection" hidden style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(47,199,142); opacity: 0.8; font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;">📣 Explorer Bonus &mdash; Share for +50 EXP</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;">
          <button id="bboShareLinkedIn" class="bbo-share-btn">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19 3A2 2 0 0 1 21 5V19A2 2 0 0 1 19 21H5A2 2 0 0 1 3 19V5A2 2 0 0 1 5 3H19M18.5 18.5V13.2A3.26 3.26 0 0 0 15.24 9.94C14.39 9.94 13.4 10.46 12.92 11.24V10.13H10.13V18.5H12.92V13.57C12.92 12.8 13.54 12.17 14.31 12.17A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 15.71 13.57V18.5H18.5M6.88 8.56A1.68 1.68 0 0 0 8.56 6.88C8.56 5.95 7.81 5.19 6.88 5.19A1.69 1.69 0 0 0 5.19 6.88C5.19 7.81 5.95 8.56 6.88 8.56M8.27 18.5V10.13H5.5V18.5H8.27Z"/></svg>
            Share on LinkedIn
          </button>
          <button id="bboShareTwitter" class="bbo-share-btn">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.744l7.737-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.253 5.622 5.91-5.622Zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
            Share on X
          </button>
          <button id="bboShareCopy" class="bbo-share-btn">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M16 1H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14h2V3h12V1zm3 4H8c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h11c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V7c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H8V7h11v14z"/></svg>
            Copy Link
          </button>
        </div>
        <p id="bboShareClaimed" hidden style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: rgb(47,199,142);">&#x2713; +50 EXP BONUS CLAIMED</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  // Scroll reveal
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.classList.add('reveal-visible');
        observer.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.08 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-hidden').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));

  // Gallery
  const track = document.getElementById('galleryTrack') as HTMLElement;
  const counter = document.getElementById('galleryCounter') as HTMLElement;
  const imgs = track ? track.querySelectorAll('.gallery-img') : [];
  let galleryCurrentIdx = 0;
  const galleryTotal = imgs.length;

  function goTo(index: number) {
    galleryCurrentIdx = (index + galleryTotal) % galleryTotal;
    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${galleryCurrentIdx * 100}%)`;
    counter.textContent = `${galleryCurrentIdx + 1} / ${galleryTotal}`;
  }

  document.getElementById('galleryPrev')?.addEventListener('click', () => goTo(galleryCurrentIdx - 1));
  document.getElementById('galleryNext')?.addEventListener('click', () => goTo(galleryCurrentIdx + 1));
  imgs.forEach(img => { (img as HTMLImageElement).addEventListener('click', () => window.open((img as HTMLImageElement).src, '_blank')); });
</script>

<style>
  .case-study-body { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 96px; color: #fff; }
  .case-section { margin-bottom: 64px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 48px; }
  .case-section-title { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255,184,0); margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .case-section-sub { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,184,0,0.6); }
  .case-field { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .case-field-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .case-field-value { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; color: #fafafa; }
  .reveal-hidden { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }
  .reveal-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .scroll-cue { position: absolute; bottom: 32px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); color: rgba(255,184,0,0.55); animation: cue-bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite; pointer-events: none; }
  @keyframes cue-bounce { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(10px); } }
  .gallery-wrap { margin-top: 20px; }
  .gallery-track-wrap { overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }
  .gallery-track { display: flex; transition: transform 0.4s ease; }
  .gallery-img { flex: 0 0 100%; width: 100%; max-height: 480px; object-fit: contain; cursor: pointer; display: block; }
  .gallery-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 14px; }
  .gallery-btn { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: #fafafa; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .gallery-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); }
  .gallery-counter { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
</style>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     EXPLORER MODE OVERLAY  (hidden until explorer is detected)
     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- HUD bar — appears below the site nav when in explorer mode -->
<div id="bbo-explorer-hud" class="bbo-hud" hidden aria-label="Explorer HUD">
  <div class="bbo-hud-inner">
    <div class="bbo-hud-left">
      <span class="bbo-hud-icon">🧭</span>
      <span class="bbo-hud-label">EXPLORER MODE</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bbo-hud-center">
      <span class="bbo-hud-rank" id="bboHudRank">CADET</span>
      <span class="bbo-hud-nick" id="bboHudNick"></span>
      <div class="bbo-hud-exp-wrap">
        <div class="bbo-hud-exp-bar">
          <div class="bbo-hud-exp-fill" id="bboHudExpFill"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="bbo-hud-exp-text" id="bboHudExpText">0 / 100 EXP</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bbo-hud-right">
      <span class="bbo-hud-progress" id="bboHudProgress"></span>
      <button class="bbo-hud-toggle" id="bboQuizToggle" aria-label="Toggle quiz panel">
        <span id="bboToggleLabel">📋 Quests</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Quiz dock — floats at bottom -->
<div id="bbo-quiz-dock" class="bbo-quiz-dock collapsed" hidden>
  <!-- Tab strip: always visible, click to expand/collapse -->
  <div class="bbo-dock-tab" id="bboDockTab" role="button" aria-label="Toggle quiz panel">
    <div class="bbo-dock-tab-left">
      <span class="bbo-dock-chevron" id="bboDockChevron">▲</span>
      <span class="bbo-dock-label">📋 Quests</span>
    </div>
    <span class="bbo-dock-status" id="bboDockStatus"></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Scrollable body (collapsed away) -->
  <div class="bbo-dock-body">
  <!-- Progress dots -->
  <div class="bbo-quiz-dots" id="bboQuizDots"></div>

  <!-- Question card -->
  <div class="bbo-quiz-card" id="bboQuizCard">
    <div class="bbo-quiz-card-header">
      <span class="bbo-quiz-num" id="bboQuizNum">1 / 5</span>
      <span class="bbo-quiz-title" id="bboQuizTitle">Loading…</span>
      <span class="bbo-quiz-exp" id="bboQuizExp">+50 EXP</span>
    </div>
    <p class="bbo-quiz-prompt" id="bboQuizPrompt"></p>
    <div class="bbo-quiz-options" id="bboQuizOptions"></div>
    <div class="bbo-quiz-footer">
      <button class="bbo-hint-btn" id="bboHintBtn">💡 Hint</button>
      <p class="bbo-hint-text" id="bboHintText" hidden></p>
      <div class="bbo-quiz-nav">
        <button class="bbo-nav-btn" id="bboPrev" aria-label="Previous question">‹ Prev</button>
        <button class="bbo-nav-btn" id="bboNext" aria-label="Next question">Next ›</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- All-done banner (shown when all 5 quiz questions complete) -->
  <div class="bbo-quiz-done" id="bboQuizDone" hidden>
    <span class="bbo-done-icon">🏆</span>
    <div>
      <p class="bbo-done-title">Boulder Box Field Study Complete!</p>
      <p class="bbo-done-sub" id="bboDoneSub">All quests cleared.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Share bonus banner (shown after quiz done; hidden once share claimed) -->
  <div class="bbo-share-banner" id="bboShareBanner" hidden>
    <span class="bbo-done-icon">📣</span>
    <div>
      <p class="bbo-done-title">Bonus Quest: Share &amp; Earn +50 EXP</p>
      <p class="bbo-done-sub">Share this page to earn a bonus. Use the share buttons below.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div><!-- end .bbo-dock-body -->
</div>

<!-- Story fragment popup -->
<div class="bbo-story-popup" id="bboStoryPopup" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="bboStoryTitle">
  <div class="bbo-story-inner">
    <div class="bbo-story-type" id="bboStoryType">DISCOVERY</div>
    <h3 class="bbo-story-title" id="bboStoryTitle"></h3>
    <p class="bbo-story-body" id="bboStoryBody"></p>
    <div class="bbo-story-footer">
      <span class="bbo-story-exp" id="bboStoryExp">+25 EXP</span>
      <button class="bbo-story-close" id="bboStoryClose">Continue ›</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
/* ── CSS custom props matching landing_minigame theme ── */
#bbo-explorer-hud,
#bbo-quiz-dock,
.bbo-story-popup {
  --bbo-accent:   rgb(47, 199, 142);
  --bbo-gold:     rgb(255, 184, 0);
  --bbo-bg:       rgba(7, 18, 7, 0.96);
  --bbo-border:   rgba(47, 199, 142, 0.3);
  --bbo-text1:    rgb(200, 230, 200);
  --bbo-text2:    rgba(200, 230, 200, 0.55);
  --bbo-glow:     rgba(47, 199, 142, 0.4);
  font-family: 'Orbitron', 'Albert Sans', monospace;
}

/* ── Hide main nav when explorer mode is active ── */
body.explorer-active .header-wrapper {
  display: none !important;
}
/* Override main's default nav-clearance padding in explorer mode */
body.explorer-active main {
  padding-top: 0 !important;
}

/* ── HUD bar ── */
.bbo-hud {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0; /* pinned to very top — main nav is hidden in explorer mode */
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 8000;
  background: var(--bbo-bg);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbo-border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  animation: bboSlideDown 0.35s ease;
}
@keyframes bboSlideDown {
  from { transform: translateY(-100%); opacity: 0; }
  to   { transform: translateY(0);     opacity: 1; }
}

.bbo-hud-inner {
  max-width: 960px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 8px 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
}

.bbo-hud-left {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bbo-hud-icon { font-size: 14px; }
.bbo-hud-label {
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  color: var(--bbo-accent);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.bbo-hud-center {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  flex: 1;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 0;
}
.bbo-hud-rank {
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: #071207;
  background: var(--bbo-accent);
  padding: 3px 10px;
  clip-path: polygon(6px 0%, 100% 0%, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0% 100%);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bbo-hud-nick {
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--bbo-text1);
  max-width: 120px;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bbo-hud-exp-wrap {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 3px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bbo-hud-exp-bar {
  width: 60px;
  height: 3px;
  background: rgba(47,199,142,0.2);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.bbo-hud-exp-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--bbo-accent);
  width: 0%;
  transition: width 0.6s ease;
  box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--bbo-glow);
}
.bbo-hud-exp-text {
  font-size: 7px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--bbo-text2);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

.bbo-hud-right {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bbo-hud-progress {
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--bbo-gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.bbo-hud-toggle {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--bbo-border);
  color: var(--bbo-accent);
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  padding: 5px 12px;
  cursor: pointer;
  clip-path: polygon(6px 0%, 100% 0%, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0% 100%);
  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
}
.bbo-hud-toggle:hover {
  background: var(--bbo-accent);
  color: #071207;
}

/* ── Quiz dock ── */
.bbo-quiz-dock {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 7900;
  background: var(--bbo-bg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--bbo-border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
  padding: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: max-height 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  max-height: 500px; /* expanded */
  animation: bboSlideUp 0.35s ease;
}

/* Collapsed: only the tab strip is visible (~36px) */
.bbo-quiz-dock.collapsed {
  max-height: 36px;
}

/* Tab strip — always visible, sits at the very top of the dock */
.bbo-dock-tab {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 16px;
  height: 36px;
  cursor: pointer;
  user-select: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.bbo-quiz-dock:not(.collapsed) .bbo-dock-tab {
  border-bottom-color: var(--bbo-border);
}
.bbo-dock-tab-left {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}
.bbo-dock-chevron {
  font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--bbo-accent);
  transition: transform 0.25s;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bbo-quiz-dock.collapsed .bbo-dock-chevron {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
}
.bbo-dock-label {
  font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
